# The archived Elixir site is kept reachable so old links do not 404, but it must not be
# indexed. Leaving it indexable would reproduce the exact failure alkeyword exists to find:
# a superseded claim ("alkeyword = observable type safety for Elixir") stated across 20 pages,
# out-weighing the current one stated on a single page. Signal dominance decides what an
# engine learns, not recency.
#
# X-Robots-Tag rather than a robots.txt Disallow on purpose: a disallowed path is never
# fetched, so a noindex placed there would never be read.
/old_scrap/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
